          "text": "Ruth."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "It was my first week. I'd done four nights straight and not slept in two days, and at 7:20 someone above me started on scales. I filled in the form on the website and went to sleep."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "Then you texted me, furious and polite and funny, and I didn't want to be the man who'd filled in the form."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "I was knackered and you were a stranger. Then you weren't."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "iain",
          "text": "I'm sorry. It was a stupid wee lie and I've felt like an eejit about it for three weeks."
        }
      ],
